# Environment files (comprehensive coverage)

*token.json*
*credentials.json*
# Phase-32 — Google Service Account JSON contains a private key.
# It MUST live on the deployment host as a mounted secret / file
# (Kubernetes Secret, EAS env file, etc.), NEVER in version control.
# `*credentials.json*` above doesn't catch the actual filename used
# by the backend (`google_service_account.json`), so list it
# explicitly. The runtime path is configured via
# `GOOGLE_SA_JSON_PATH` in backend/.env.
google_service_account.json
backend/google_service_account.json
/app/backend/google_service_account.json

# Logs and debug files
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
dump.rdb

